1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:07,330
Miliye BeFocus se — ek free app jo aapko apne phone aur apne time par wapas control deta hai.

2
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:14,545
Hum mein se zyada log roz ghanton reels, shorts aur distracting apps mein waste kar dete hain.

3
00:00:14,545 --> 00:00:17,322
Adult content bas ek tap door hota hai.

4
00:00:17,322 --> 00:00:25,200
Aur zyadatar blockers weak moment mein easily off ho jaate hain, isliye woh actually help nahi karte.

5
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:28,175
BeFocus ye problem solve karta hai.

6
00:00:28,175 --> 00:00:45,036
Ye aapke chune hue apps ko schedule par ya daily limit ke baad block karta hai, reels aur shorts block karta hai jabki baaki app chalta rehta hai, adult websites aur keywords filter karta hai, aur khud ko uninstall hone se bachata hai.

7
00:00:45,036 --> 00:00:51,710
Ise off karne mein 48 ghante lagte hain, ya kisi trusted dost ka code chahiye.

8
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:54,041
Chaliye install karte hain.

9
00:00:54,041 --> 00:01:00,704
BeFocus abhi Play Store par nahi hai, isliye hum APK GitHub se download karenge.

10
00:01:00,704 --> 00:01:09,618
Chrome kholiye, Google par “BeFocus APK GitHub” search kijiye, aur befocus-apk wale result par tap kijiye.

11
00:01:09,618 --> 00:01:14,580
Aap screen par dikhaya gaya link bhi type kar sakte hain.

12
00:01:14,930 --> 00:01:21,139
GitHub page par BeFocus APK file par tap kijiye, phir Download par tap kijiye.

13
00:01:21,139 --> 00:01:30,107
Chrome warning de sakta hai ki ye file harmful ho sakti hai — ye Play Store ke bahar ki har APK ke liye aata hai.

14
00:01:30,107 --> 00:01:33,330
“Download anyway” par tap kijiye.

15
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:36,158
Download hui file open kijiye.

16
00:01:36,158 --> 00:01:41,199
Android, Chrome se apps install karne ki permission maangega.

17
00:01:41,199 --> 00:01:47,730
Settings par tap kijiye, “Allow from this source” on kijiye, aur back aaiye.

18
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:49,803
Install par tap kijiye.

19
00:01:49,803 --> 00:01:57,025
BeFocus naya hai aur Play Store se nahi hai, isliye Google Play Protect warning dikha sakta hai.

20
00:01:57,025 --> 00:02:01,374
“More details” par tap kijiye, phir “Install anyway” par.

21
00:02:01,374 --> 00:02:12,920
Play Protect aise naye blocker apps par aksar warning deta hai, kyunki woh apna kaam karne ke liye accessibility aur device admin use karte hain.

22
00:02:13,270 --> 00:02:23,448
Agar “Install anyway” nahi dikhta, to Play Store kholiye, apni profile picture par tap kijiye, phir Play Protect, phir settings icon par.

23
00:02:23,448 --> 00:02:33,540
“Scan apps with Play Protect” off kijiye, BeFocus install kijiye, aur phir phone ki safety ke liye scanning wapas on kar dijiye.

24
00:02:33,890 --> 00:02:46,170
Android 13 aur usse naye phones par, Play Store ke bahar se install kiye gaye apps mein restricted settings hoti hain, isliye Accessibility switch grey dikh sakta hai.

25
00:02:46,170 --> 00:02:50,826
Ise fix karne ke liye Settings kholiye, phir Apps, phir BeFocus.

26
00:02:50,826 --> 00:03:01,890
Upar right side mein teen dots wale menu par tap kijiye, “Allow restricted settings” chuniye, aur apne PIN ya fingerprint se confirm kijiye.

27
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:06,346
Ab BeFocus kholiye aur “Get started” par tap kijiye.

28
00:03:06,346 --> 00:03:10,976
Permissions screen batati hai ki BeFocus ko kya chahiye.

29
00:03:10,976 --> 00:03:15,694
Accessibility aur Display over other apps required hain.

30
00:03:15,694 --> 00:03:23,382
Device admin, unrestricted battery aur notifications optional hain, lekin recommended hain.

31
00:03:23,382 --> 00:03:26,640
Chaliye ek-ek karke sab on karte hain.

32
00:03:26,990 --> 00:03:29,169
Sabse pehle Accessibility.

33
00:03:29,169 --> 00:03:38,977
Isse BeFocus dekh pata hai ki screen par kaun sa app, reel ya website hai, taaki woh aapke chune hue ko block kar sake.

34
00:03:38,977 --> 00:03:42,518
Notice padhiye aur “I agree” par tap kijiye.

35
00:03:42,518 --> 00:03:52,325
Accessibility settings mein Downloaded apps kholiye, BeFocus par tap kijiye, use on kijiye, aur Allow par tap kijiye.

36
00:03:52,325 --> 00:03:59,050
Sab kuch aapke phone par hi rehta hai — kuch bhi collect ya share nahi hota.

37
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:02,065
Next, Display over other apps.

38
00:04:02,065 --> 00:04:07,662
Isse BeFocus blocked app ke upar apni focus screen dikha pata hai.

39
00:04:07,662 --> 00:04:15,320
Allow par tap kijiye, BeFocus dhoondhiye, aur “Allow display over other apps” on kijiye.

40
00:04:15,670 --> 00:04:20,587
Device admin sirf uninstall protection ke liye use hota hai.

41
00:04:20,587 --> 00:04:25,013
Ye weak moment mein BeFocus ko remove hone se rokta hai.

42
00:04:25,013 --> 00:04:30,480
Allow par tap kijiye, phir “Activate this device admin app” par.

43
00:04:30,830 --> 00:04:31,752
Ab battery.

44
00:04:31,752 --> 00:04:39,544
Bahut se phones battery bachane ke liye background apps band kar dete hain, jisse blocker ruk jayega.

45
00:04:39,544 --> 00:04:47,336
Allow par tap kijiye, aur jab Android pooche ki BeFocus ko background mein chalne dein, to Allow chuniye.

46
00:04:47,336 --> 00:04:54,840
Kuch phones par App info, phir App battery usage kholkar “Unrestricted” bhi select kijiye.

47
00:04:55,190 --> 00:05:00,606
Last mein, daily focus summary ke liye notifications allow kijiye.

48
00:05:00,606 --> 00:05:03,959
Ab paanchon permissions “On” dikh rahi hain.

49
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:06,400
Continue par tap kijiye.

50
00:05:06,750 --> 00:05:09,888
Ab ek accountability partner add kijiye.

51
00:05:09,888 --> 00:05:21,154
Aapka dost is QR code ko Google Authenticator jaise kisi authenticator app se scan karta hai, aur confirm karne ke liye 6 digit ka code batata hai.

52
00:05:21,154 --> 00:05:28,235
Baad mein agar sach mein protection off karni ho, to unka current code turant unlock kar deta hai.

53
00:05:28,235 --> 00:05:33,130
Partner ke bina, aapko bas 48 ghante wait karna hoga.

54
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:35,437
Ye aapki home screen hai.

55
00:05:35,437 --> 00:05:51,050
Shuru mein sab kuch off rehta hai, isliye Shields kholiye aur jo chahiye woh on kijiye: Reels aur Shorts, short-video apps, adult content filter, aapki apni block list, aur uninstall protection.

56
00:05:51,400 --> 00:06:00,297
Kisi app ko block karne ke liye Apps mein jaaiye, Add par tap kijiye, aur koi app chuniye, jaise Instagram.

57
00:06:00,297 --> 00:06:06,969
Din aur from-to time chuniye, jaise weekdays mein subah 9 se shaam 5 baje tak.

58
00:06:06,969 --> 00:06:11,232
Ya daily limit chuniye, jaise din mein 30 minute.

59
00:06:11,232 --> 00:06:13,450
Save par tap kijiye.

60
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:23,199
Instagram, YouTube, Facebook aur Snapchat mein Reels aur Shorts block hote hain, jabki messages aur baaki app chalta rehta hai.

61
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:32,841
Adult filter 50,000 se zyada websites aur keywords cover karta hai, har browser mein aur kisi bhi app ke search box mein.

62
00:06:32,841 --> 00:06:37,280
Aap apni websites aur keywords bhi add kar sakte hain.

63
00:06:37,630 --> 00:06:43,864
Jab kuch block hota hai, to aapko 60 second ke liye ye focus screen dikhti hai.

64
00:06:43,864 --> 00:06:50,355
Ise skip nahi kar sakte — Home aur Recents dabane par bhi ye turant wapas aa jaati hai.

65
00:06:50,355 --> 00:06:57,700
“Why was this blocked?” card batata hai ki block kis wajah se hua, aur kis setting ne kiya.

66
00:06:57,700 --> 00:07:01,201
Is screen ka ad BeFocus ko free rakhta hai.

67
00:07:01,201 --> 00:07:05,680
Phone calls aur emergency calls hamesha chalte hain.

68
00:07:06,030 --> 00:07:13,610
Uninstall protection on hone par, BeFocus ki app info aur uninstall screens bhi block ho jaati hain.

69
00:07:13,610 --> 00:07:18,558
Protection change ya remove karne ke liye Lock and unlock kholiye.

70
00:07:18,558 --> 00:07:24,861
Ya to apne partner ka current code daaliye, ya 48 ghante ka wait start kijiye.

71
00:07:24,861 --> 00:07:29,720
Zyadatar cravings usse bahut pehle hi khatam ho jaati hain.

72
00:07:30,070 --> 00:07:33,630
BeFocus poori tarah aapke phone par kaam karta hai.

73
00:07:33,630 --> 00:07:39,509
Aap jo dekhte ya type karte hain, use ye na collect karta hai na share karta hai.

74
00:07:39,509 --> 00:07:45,690
Aaj hi screen par diye link se download kijiye, aur apna time wapas lijiye.

